Keep a shared start as empty text.
Place "RXXLRXRXL" into start.
Keep a shared finish as empty text.
Place "XRLXXRRLX" into finish.
Keep a shared first as 0.
Keep a shared second as 0.
Keep a shared startlast as 0.
Keep a shared finishlast as 0.
Keep a shared verdict as 0.
Keep a shared leftmove as 0.
Set startlast to 8.
Set finishlast to 8.
Set verdict to 1.

To skipstart from spot (a whole number).
If spot is more than startlast, set first to spot, return.
The piece is the slice of start from spot to spot plus 1.
If piece matches "X", skipstart from spot plus 1, return.
Set first to spot.

To skipfinish from spot (a whole number).
If spot is more than finishlast, set second to spot, return.
The piece is the slice of finish from spot to spot plus 1.
If piece matches "X", skipfinish from spot plus 1, return.
Set second to spot.

To compare from left (a whole number) with right (a whole number).
Set first to left.
Skipstart from left.
Set second to right.
Skipfinish from right.
If first is more than startlast and second is more than finishlast, return.
If first is more than startlast or second is more than finishlast, set verdict to 0, return.
The leftspot is first, while the rightspot is second.
The one is the slice of start from leftspot to leftspot plus 1.
The two is the slice of finish from rightspot to rightspot plus 1.
If one does not match two, set verdict to 0, return.
Set leftmove to 0.
The rightmove is 0.
If one matches "L", set leftmove to 1.
If one matches "R", set rightmove to 1.
If leftmove is 1 and second is more than first, set verdict to 0, return.
If rightmove is 1 and second is less than first, set verdict to 0, return.
Compare from first plus 1 with second plus 1.

Compare from 0 with 0.
If verdict is 1, show true, otherwise show false.
